  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Blas">Blas.</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">and hæbbe se teond cyre, swa wæterordal swa ysenordal, swa hwæðer [swa] him leofra sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And the man who is accused shall go to the ordeal, and the accuser shall choose either the ordeal by water or the ordeal by iron—whichever he prefers.]</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And the person charged is to go himself to the ordeal, and the accuser to have a choice between water-ordeal and iron-ordeal.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 hæbbe se ðe tyhð cyre swa wæterordal swa isenordal, swa hwæðer swa him leofre sy.</ab>
      </div>
